# UNVERIFIED - scripts-only repository
#
# Strategy: ignore everything in the project root, then re-include
# only what we want to track. Order matters: ignore first, un-ignore after.
# Third-party assets (3D models, UI, audio, fonts) are intentionally excluded
# because their licenses do not allow redistribution.

# Ignore everything at the repository root
/*

# Re-include root files we want to track
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# Re-include the Assets folder itself (required before un-ignoring its children)
!/Assets/

# Inside Assets, ignore everything...
/Assets/*

# ...except the Scripts folder and its meta file
!/Assets/Scripts/
!/Assets/Scripts.meta

# OS / editor junk (safety net, in case it appears inside Scripts)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.user
*.suo
.vs/